{
  "name": "Telegram 雙向通訊與指令自動回覆工作流",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✈️ 範例 3：Telegram 雙向通訊與指令自動回覆\n\n1. **Telegram Trigger**：監聽使用者傳入的訊息與指令。\n2. **Switch 路由分流**：依照 `/start`、`/help`、`/info` 或一般文字進行多路分流。\n3. **Telegram Node**：針對不同指令回傳對應的選單、說明與客製化回應。",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 420
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        120
      ],
      "id": "telegram-bot-note",
      "name": "流程說明"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        -180,
        380
      ],
      "id": "telegram-trigger-bot",
      "name": "Telegram 訊息觸發器",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "chat-id",
              "name": "chatId",
              "value": "={{ $json.message.chat.id }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "user-name",
              "name": "userName",
              "value": "={{ $json.message.from.first_name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "user-message",
              "name": "userMessage",
              "value": "={{ ($json.message.text || '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        60,
        380
      ],
      "id": "extract-bot-params",
      "name": "提取對話參數"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "is-start",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.userMessage }}",
                    "rightValue": "/start",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "startsWith"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Start 指令"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "is-help",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.userMessage }}",
                    "rightValue": "/help",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "startsWith"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Help 指令"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "is-info",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.userMessage }}",
                    "rightValue": "/info",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "startsWith"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Info 指令"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        300,
        380
      ],
      "id": "route-commands",
      "name": "指令與文字路由器"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "=👋 *歡迎使用 n8n Telegram 智慧機器人！*\n\n哈囉 {{ $json.userName }}，很高興為您服務！\n\n您可以使用下方指令探索機器人功能：\n• `/start` - 顯示歡迎與功能總覽\n• `/help` - 查看指令說明手冊\n• `/info` - 查看機器人運行狀態\n\n或直接輸入任何文字，我會即時為您確認！",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown",
          "reply_markup": {
            "inline_keyboard": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "📖 瀏覽說明手冊",
                  "url": "https://docs.n8n.io"
                },
                {
                  "text": "⚡ 進入 n8n 畫布",
                  "url": "https://n8n.io"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        600,
        200
      ],
      "id": "reply-start-command",
      "name": "回覆 Start 指令",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "=📚 *n8n 機器人指令說明手冊*\n\n以下為目前支援的快捷指令列表：\n\n1️⃣ `/start` ：重新開啟主選單。\n2️⃣ `/help` ：查看本指令說明與支援管道。\n3️⃣ `/info` ：查詢伺服器連線狀態與版本資訊。\n\n💡 _提示：在輸入框直接鍵入 `/` 即可自動跳出 Telegram 官方指令選單！_",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        600,
        340
      ],
      "id": "reply-help-command",
      "name": "回覆 Help 指令",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "=ℹ️ *系統狀態資訊*\n\n• 🤖 *Bot 版本*：`v1.0.0 (n8n Engine)`\n• 🟢 *服務狀態*：`正常運行 (Active)`\n• 👤 *您的用戶 ID*：`{{ $json.chatId }}`\n• 🕒 *伺服器時間*：_{{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') }}_",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        600,
        480
      ],
      "id": "reply-info-command",
      "name": "回覆 Info 指令",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "=💬 哈囉 {{ $json.userName }}！\n\n已收到您的訊息：\n> 「{{ $json.userMessage }}」\n\n如需查看功能列表，請輸入 `/help` 或 `/start`！\n\n🕒 處理時間：{{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        600,
        620
      ],
      "id": "reply-default-message",
      "name": "回覆一般文字訊息",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
